  Method: We develop Inverse Planning by Integer Program (IPIP), an <span class="search-hit mathjax">optimization</span> mo&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('1012.0048v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('1012.0048v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
