        Several approaches exist to model gravitational lens systems. In this study, we apply global <span class="search-hit mathjax">optimization</span> methods to find the&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('1210.6572v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('1210.6572v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
